    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout single\" data-layout=\"single\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d5207275-4ee0-4a3d-bf39-85fa8f7980f8\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>This guide is currently In-Progress. Over the next few months, content will be added to it. </p><p>If you have any suggestions or would like to add pages which talk about the functionality of Bahmni, please feel free to add them.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ChangeBahmniConnectAppLocation-Purpose\">Purpose</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni Connect allows the user to access Bahmni in areas where there is limited or no internet connectivity.</span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> Bahmni Connect records ramped down medical information about patients. The information collected in Bahmni Connect gets synced with the Bahmni online server (mother location) when the device gets internet connectivity.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Once initially synced, the location gets mapped to the device. If the device needs to service a new location then the application has to be removed, re-installed and then synced to the new location. Please find the steps with the associated screenshots below.</span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a6779f13-dac5-435a-8df0-b537199a3796\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The screenshots below are taken from a Samsung tablet running on Android version 4.2.2. Based on tablet UI and Android version there may be slight variance in steps</p></div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"52c44f89-74d0-42a2-8109-623960ab2499\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Please note that the device can be mapped to a new location only when the device has internet connectivity</p></div></div><p><br/></p><h2 id=\"ChangeBahmniConnectAppLocation-Steps\">Steps</h2><p>1.Switch on the Device</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776280\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"1 - Switch on the Device.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"4bcdf75e-fda0-4cc0-96fa-aa2346626ba1\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p>2. Navigate to Application Manager</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/2%20-%20Go%20to%20Application%20Manager.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679729837&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/2%20-%20Go%20to%20Application%20Manager.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679729837&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776281\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"2 - Go to Application Manager.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"2ff204f8-7776-400b-a404-99f34b123c24\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/2%20-%20Go%20to%20Application%20Manager.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679729837&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/2%20-%20Go%20to%20Application%20Manager.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679729837&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p>3. Uninstall Bahmni Connect from the Device<br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/3%20-%20Uninstall%20Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679784465&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/3%20-%20Uninstall%20Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679784465&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776282\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"3 - Uninstall Bahmni.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"3ad1dde3-3f25-4754-b4bf-0d612f136b3f\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/3%20-%20Uninstall%20Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679784465&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/3%20-%20Uninstall%20Bahmni.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480679784465&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p>4. Go to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-connect-0.87-8.apk\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-connect-0.87-8.apk</a></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a8f0e03a-efd7-4824-9c59-cc45a2d6aab4\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Incase of the chromium application go to:</p><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-connect-0.87-8.tar.gz\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-connect-0.87-8.tar.gz</a></p><ul><li>Download the .tar.gz file</li><li>Unzip the file</li><li>Go to apps in Chrome</li><li>Click on Settings&gt;Extension&gt;Load Unpacked Extension&gt;Load the Extension File</li></ul></div></div><p><br/></p><p>7. Wait Until Bahmni APK Is Downloaded on the Device</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/Screenshot_2016-12-02-16-26-15.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680060635&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/Screenshot_2016-12-02-16-26-15.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680060635&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776287\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot_2016-12-02-16-26-15.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"7933e9e7-6432-4c4a-baf0-4504664b0c63\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/Screenshot_2016-12-02-16-26-15.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680060635&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/Screenshot_2016-12-02-16-26-15.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680060635&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p>8. Install the APK</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/10%20-%20Install%20the%20Offline%20APK%20Again.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680178974&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/10%20-%20Install%20the%20Offline%20APK%20Again.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680178974&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776290\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"10 - Install the Offline APK Again.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"86f7a235-3b53-417e-8355-71453cfc8366\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/10%20-%20Install%20the%20Offline%20APK%20Again.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680178974&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/10%20-%20Install%20the%20Offline%20APK%20Again.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680178974&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p>9. Open Bahmni Application on the Device</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776280\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"1 - Switch on the Device.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"4bcdf75e-fda0-4cc0-96fa-aa2346626ba1\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/1%20-%20Switch%20on%20the%20Device.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1480680642821&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p>10. Enter the Hostname of Bahmni Online Server</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/12%20-%20Enter%20the%20Hostname%20of%20Bahmni%20Online.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680686190&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/12%20-%20Enter%20the%20Hostname%20of%20Bahmni%20Online.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680686190&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776296\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"12 - Enter the Hostname of Bahmni Online.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"70a4725f-3d56-475d-aa7c-f253d3bf51f1\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/12%20-%20Enter%20the%20Hostname%20of%20Bahmni%20Online.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680686190&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/12%20-%20Enter%20the%20Hostname%20of%20Bahmni%20Online.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680686190&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p>11. Select the New Location, Enter Your User Credentials and Sync</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/13%20-%20Select%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680967060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/13%20-%20Select%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680967060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776298\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"13 - Select the New Location.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"f550b4e3-a232-4565-a6ca-30eaabb20893\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/13%20-%20Select%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680967060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=1024 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/13%20-%20Select%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480680967060&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=682 1x\"></span></p><p>12. Sync the Device to the New Location</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/14%20-%20Sync%20the%20Device%20to%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480681018636&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=410\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/97026058/14%20-%20Sync%20the%20Device%20to%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480681018636&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"103776300\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"14 - Sync the Device to the New Location.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"8a6e5a0f-13c3-4f75-a108-3b76814d237a\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/14%20-%20Sync%20the%20Device%20to%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480681018636&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1024&amp;height=600 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/97026058/14%20-%20Sync%20the%20Device%20to%20the%20New%20Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1480681018636&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=410 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6fa4bf67-9d60-479a-af15-c6e2659df324\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>And you are good to go!</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"8450e577-7882-4e1b-ae52-c2950ec062ba\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"2ecf4e5d-ee5a-47a2-8fca-c2f2091f69d8\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c5e56f04-8483-4243-9c94-2e0ccc32752e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Pages</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-ma